{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CalendarNotes 是一款主打極簡與可愛風格的提醒事項應用，適合追求介面清爽且厭倦複雜操作的用戶。它沒有多餘的功能堆砌，讓你能以輕鬆愉悅的心情記錄生活點滴，目前正限時免費開放下載。</p>\n\n<h2>優雅呈現日常備忘</h2>\n<p>這款應用提供直覺的日期選擇與筆記功能，支援每週重複提醒以滿足課程或健身需求。其特色在於可自訂重複項目的顯示方式，並結合日曆視圖一目了然掌握行程。此外，它還具備離線可用的本地通知、Silent Mode 下仍可響鈴的持久鬧鐘以及主畫面小工具，讓提醒既實用又充滿趣味。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-525-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-526-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-527-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-528-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-529-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-530-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CalendarNotes: Cute Reminder</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T23:59:24.687235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}